WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.420
Europe is in serious trouble.

00:02.420 --> 00:05.580
They've been invaded by a force of illegal aliens

00:05.580 --> 00:07.620
like nobody's ever seen before.

00:07.620 --> 00:10.160
Illegal aliens are pouring into Europe.

00:10.160 --> 00:13.320
Nobody is ever, and nobody's doing anything

00:13.320 --> 00:14.580
to change it, to get them out.

